        {
            "title": "Announcement on the Cessation of Sales for This Game",
            "date": "2025-08-14 03:05:03",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1808061939331589",
            "content": "[p]Dear Players,[/p][p]\n[/p][p]Thank you for your continuous support and companionship towards this game. Due to adjustments at the operational level, after careful consideration, we hereby notify you that: as of the date of this announcement, this game will cease new user downloads and related in-game paid sales services.[/p][p]\n[/p][p]It should be noted that players who have successfully downloaded the game and have an account can still log in normally, experience all existing gameplay content, and your game data will be properly preserved.[/p][p]\n[/p][p]Once again, thank you for your understanding and support during the operation of the game.[/p]"
        },
